WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.360
This is an average American family.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.260
And so is this.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.920
And so are these.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.880
Every family is different.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.760
But some families are more different than others.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.680
Get out!

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.000
It's hideous.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.380
It's horrible.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.440
It's home.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.380
Is that really as tight as you can make it?

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.220
Hello.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.260
Wednesday. What do you have there?

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:46.520
I'm not sure.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:51.660
Strange... there's usually a murderous clown attached to the other end of these.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.560
Come now, Gomez.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.580
Don't forget to kick your father, good night.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.020
Yes, mother.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:07.560
Pugsley, blow F-6!

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.880
Fire in the hole!

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:17.220
Yes!

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.434
You sunk my battleship!

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.140
Well done, Pugsley!

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:26.900
How I wish something would liven up this already tedious day.

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:31.740
Thanks for trying, Ichabod.

